  "prefLabel": "Site 102.28 Motion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.28 “Motion” means a request made to the committee or the presiding officer after the commencement of a contested proceeding for an order or ruling directing some act to be done in favor of the party making the motion, including a statement of justification or reasons for the request.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15 (from Site 102.10)",
